-- Seed catalog books (+ genres) for fresh installs.
-- Skips when books already exist so local/dev DBs with data are not duplicated.

DO $seed$
BEGIN
  IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.books LIMIT 1) THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Skipping V2 book seed: books table is not empty';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  A decade earlier, Oliver was one of seven young Shakespearean actors at Dellecher Classical Conservatory, a place of keen ambition and fierce competition. In this secluded world of firelight and leather-bound books, Oliver and his friends played the same roles onstage and off: hero, villain, tyrant, temptress, ingénue, extras. But in their fourth and final year, good-natured rivalries turned ugly, and on opening night real violence invaded the students'' world of make-believe. In the morning, the fourth-years found themselves facing their very own tragedy, and their greatest acting challenge yet: convincing the police, each other, and themselves that they are innocent.
  A dark, atmospheric debut that blends Shakespearean drama with a gripping murder mystery, exploring love, obsession, and the dangerous line between performance and reality', 'if we were villains', 2017, 1, 'If We Were Villains', 1, 'ml rio', NULL);
  PERFORM pg_catalog.setval('public.books_id_seq', 19, true);
END
$seed$;
